WEBVTT

00:09:58.045 --> 00:10:01.132
ambaye alikuwa hajui hata kongosho ni nini

00:10:01.132 --> 00:10:04.706
anaweza akavumbua njia mpya ya kugundua kansa ya kongosho.

00:10:04.706 --> 00:10:07.197
jaribu kufikiri unaweza ukafanya mangapi.

00:10:07.197 --> 00:10:08.529
Asante sana

00:10:08.529 --> 00:10:14.237
(makofi)